  "question": {
    "text": "In an acid-base titration, <math><mn>0.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math> solution was added to the <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> solution of unknown strength. Which of the following correctly shown the change of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> of the titration mixture in this experiment?<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7a5313b8-4efb-4a9a-b8fa-e7d0bdfdfbbb-image.png\" style=\"width: 499px; height: 424px;\" />",
